            "review_text": "Chris S\n6 contributions\n0\nAbsolutely delicious!\nFeb 2017 • Couples\nThis restaurant is incredible.\n\nLocation is perfect - across from the Angsow Bridge in D7.\n\nAmbience is fabulous.\n\nAs for the food, unbelievable! We ordered the seafood and veg fried rice, thai style steam clams and grilled lemongrass beef. All i can say is be prepared for you to experience flavor you have never been exposed to before. I cant really explain any other way - the food is simply incredible.\nRead more\nWritten February 27, 2017",
